        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "毛 is the conversational money unit equal to one 角. A money amount does not require another classifier.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "这个一毛钱。",
                "pinyin": "zhè gè yī máo qián 。",
                "meaning": "This costs one tenth of a yuan.",
